{#- All three forgot-password pages POST to the same /members/forgot-password
    route, which Caddy rewrites to the n8n `resend-password` webhook.

    The `lang` in the body is deliberately NOT what decides the email's
    language. *(Corrected Aug 10, 2026 — this comment previously said the field
    existed so the workflow could pick a language, and that the workflow "does
    not read it yet." Both halves are now wrong.)* The `Build Resend Email` node
    reads `preferred_language` off the subscriber_tokens row instead, which
    `Look Up Active Token` already SELECTs. Same reasoning as the login routing
    in auth_service/app.py: the database knows who the person is, the page only
    knows which screen they happened to open — someone can land here from the
    Spanish page and still be a Portuguese subscriber.

    `lang` is kept because it costs nothing and the not-found branch may want it
    one day. Nothing reads it today. Do not treat it as load-bearing. -#}
<div class="card">
  <h1>Recuperar contraseña</h1>
  <p class="sub" id="sub">Ingresá el email con el que te suscribiste a All-Access. Si está registrado, te enviamos la contraseña.</p>

  <form id="forgot-form">
    <label for="email">Email</label>
    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email">
    <button type="submit" id="submit-btn">Enviar</button>
  </form>

  <p class="result" id="result"></p>

  <p class="help"><a href="/members/login">Volver al login</a></p>

  <p class="auth-lang">
    <a href="/members/forgot-password" class="current">Español</a><span class="sep">·</span><a href="/members/en/forgot-password">English</a><span class="sep">·</span><a href="/members/pt/forgot-password">Português</a>
  </p>
</div>

<script>
  var form = document.getElementById('forgot-form');
  var sub = document.getElementById('sub');
  var result = document.getElementById('result');
  var submitBtn = document.getElementById('submit-btn');

  form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    submitBtn.disabled = true;
    submitBtn.textContent = 'Enviando...';

    fetch('/members/forgot-password', {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify({ email: document.getElementById('email').value.trim(), lang: 'es' })
    })
      .then(function () {
        result.textContent = 'Si el email está registrado, te enviamos la contraseña. Revisá tu bandeja de entrada.';
        result.classList.add('show');
        form.style.display = 'none';
        sub.style.display = 'none';
      })
      .catch(function () {
        result.textContent = 'Algo salió mal. Escribinos a coach@triaperformance.com.';
        result.classList.add('show');
        submitBtn.disabled = false;
        submitBtn.textContent = 'Enviar';
      });
  });
</script>
